(5796258, 843762, 111808, '<td valign="top">Love the motion of this ocean, pure power waves splashing up against the stalwart rocks then coming back down silently to flow out again in a constant tidal motion. Your capture is spot on perfect.</td>', 'Love the motion of this ocean, pure power waves splashing up against the stalwart rocks then coming back down silently to flow out again in a constant tidal motion. Your capture is spot on perfect.', '2010-01-04 22:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796266, 844602, 77196, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but IMO there''s just not enough of the reflection to carry the shot. Lots of white and black.</td>', 'I like the idea, but IMO there''s just not enough of the reflection to carry the shot. Lots of white and black.', '2010-01-04 22:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796273, 843762, 77196, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love the lighting in this - the key "keeper" is the rock in the foreground, and tops of the tall waves.</td>', 'Absolutely love the lighting in this - the key "keeper" is the rock in the foreground, and tops of the tall waves.', '2010-01-04 22:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796280, 843892, 111808, '<td valign="top">I love how the rocks make a frame for this gentle ocean and the perspective gives the impression of a narrowing gap closed in by the ragged sculptured textures of the stone. There is just a small hint way in the distance of land and sky but this passage will take great care. Expressive &amp; beautiful photograph.</td>', 'I love how the rocks make a frame for this gentle ocean and the perspective gives the impression of a narrowing gap closed in by the ragged sculptured textures of the stone. There is just a small hint way in the distance of land and sky but this passage will take great care. Expressive & beautiful photograph.', '2010-01-04 22:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796283, 844268, 77196, '<td valign="top">Why? To look at the moon by myself? I like the idea, but IMO the shot is missing a major component that would pull the user in (use a timer with you on the bench?). Also, because of the angle, and the nature of the bench &amp; water, the shot looks foreshortened, without the expected amount of distance between objects.</td>', 'Why? To look at the moon by myself? I like the idea, but IMO the shot is missing a major component that would pull the user in (use a timer with you on the bench?). Also, because of the angle, and the nature of the bench & water, the shot looks foreshortened, without the expected amount of distance between objects.', '2010-01-04 22:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796289, 843846, 77196, '<td valign="top">IMO, the foreground in shadow just kills this shot. Great gaggle of birds, but the wonderful light in the background just emphasizes its absence in the foregound. Not a whole bunch you could do about it, unless the birds were moving slowly away.</td>', 'IMO, the foreground in shadow just kills this shot. Great gaggle of birds, but the wonderful light in the background just emphasizes its absence in the foregound. Not a whole bunch you could do about it, unless the birds were moving slowly away.', '2010-01-04 22:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796293, 844416, 77196, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot. A key for me is that both eyes are clearly visible, even though one side of the face is in shadow.</td>', 'Awesome shot. A key for me is that both eyes are clearly visible, even though one side of the face is in shadow.', '2010-01-04 22:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796300, 844408, 77196, '<td valign="top">This does an excellent job of capturing the emotion of the title. The wood in the foreground saves this from being "just another landscape shot".</td>', 'This does an excellent job of capturing the emotion of the title. The wood in the foreground saves this from being "just another landscape shot".', '2010-01-04 22:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796305, 843114, 111808, '<td valign="top">And this is a cool cool snowscape complete with beautiful still reflections. Pristine winter shot, very peaceful and inviting.</td>', 'And this is a cool cool snowscape complete with beautiful still reflections. Pristine winter shot, very peaceful and inviting.', '2010-01-04 22:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796306, 844620, 77196, '<td valign="top">Is that really a Nikon? Nice shot. Not sure if the "scuz"/"grime" helps or hurts this.</td>', 'Is that really a Nikon? Nice shot. Not sure if the "scuz"/"grime" helps or hurts this.', '2010-01-04 22:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796321, 844238, 111808, '<td valign="top">Such a simple entry and yet it is so very effective with the reflection on the stark black background. The sound of silence perhaps because the creature who called it home has long since gone and only the essence of the Life remains. If you pick up the shell, do you hear the ocean calling still?</td>', 'Such a simple entry and yet it is so very effective with the reflection on the stark black background. The sound of silence perhaps because the creature who called it home has long since gone and only the essence of the Life remains. If you pick up the shell, do you hear the ocean calling still?', '2010-01-04 22:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796347, 844297, 111808, '<td valign="top">Pristine mountainscape - the jagged rock pointing upwards and to the right which is echoed again and again in the waves of the treelines. There is sweet light on various spots of this in just the right places to make it pop. The lines and repeating shapes make a very complementary balanced whole and make it a joy to look at. Beautiful work.</td>', 'Pristine mountainscape - the jagged rock pointing upwards and to the right which is echoed again and again in the waves of the treelines. There is sweet light on various spots of this in just the right places to make it pop. The lines and repeating shapes make a very complementary balanced whole and make it a joy to look at. Beautiful work.', '2010-01-04 22:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796369, 844268, 103427, '<td valign="top">It''s freezing looking!</td>', 'It''s freezing looking!', '2010-01-04 22:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796393, 843811, 111808, '<td valign="top">WOW!! That is a WAVE!! What awesome power the sea has and how perfectly you have captured this explosive burst of thunderous water. The lone small figure in blue on the right hand side provides a real time perspective of just how massive this is. I LOVE this view.</td>', 'WOW!! That is a WAVE!! What awesome power the sea has and how perfectly you have captured this explosive burst of thunderous water. The lone small figure in blue on the right hand side provides a real time perspective of just how massive this is. I LOVE this view.', '2010-01-04 23:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796407, 844388, 103427, '<td valign="top">Crop from the right and it would be a great photo. I still gave it pretty high number.</td>', 'Crop from the right and it would be a great photo. I still gave it pretty high number.', '2010-01-04 23:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796411, 844185, 103427, '<td valign="top">He is, but this is not the best photo. :(</td>', 'He is, but this is not the best photo. :(', '2010-01-04 23:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796429, 844031, 111808, '<td valign="top">Your photograph perfectly encapsulates this lyric. The black and white tones of the symmetrical patterned bridge with the soft peacefully blanketed landscape seen behind and the grey snow sky touching the skeleton trees speaks of the sense of loss which is so evident in the song. The buildings of so called civilisation are so very far away. This capture is superb.</td>', 'Your photograph perfectly encapsulates this lyric. The black and white tones of the symmetrical patterned bridge with the soft peacefully blanketed landscape seen behind and the grey snow sky touching the skeleton trees speaks of the sense of loss which is so evident in the song. The buildings of so called civilisation are so very far away. This capture is superb.', '2010-01-04 23:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796431, 844467, 103427, '<td valign="top">This is a bit disturbing. Some of the hardcore violence should not be allowed, in my opinion. This goes overboard.</td>', 'This is a bit disturbing. Some of the hardcore violence should not be allowed, in my opinion. This goes overboard.', '2010-01-04 23:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796438, 844407, 111808, '<td valign="top">I like this nightscape especially how the variously coloured lights ripple out into the wider expanse of river. It illustrates your theme of peaceful even though the buildings beyond are glowing, active, alive and full of urban promises. The exposure is spot on.</td>', 'I like this nightscape especially how the variously coloured lights ripple out into the wider expanse of river. It illustrates your theme of peaceful even though the buildings beyond are glowing, active, alive and full of urban promises. The exposure is spot on.', '2010-01-04 23:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
