(5796755, 844185, 56828, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if it was an invert or not, but it doesn''t really work well for the photo.  I''m also not a fan of the crop.</td>', 'I''m not sure if it was an invert or not, but it doesn''t really work well for the photo.  I''m also not a fan of the crop.', '2010-01-05 10:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796757, 844602, 56828, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming you were going for the eye forming a man shape in the frame.  I don''t think that it really hit hte mark.  Can''t really say that if it did, i would connect the title.  I''m not sure if the high key approach works here.</td>', 'I''m assuming you were going for the eye forming a man shape in the frame.  I don''t think that it really hit hte mark.  Can''t really say that if it did, i would connect the title.  I''m not sure if the high key approach works here.', '2010-01-05 10:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
