(5796762, 842754, 56828, '<td valign="top">What''s outrageous about it?  I''m also not sure where you want my focus to be.  Your eyes sort of take you to the background in which the ice is distracating...but if you want us to the look at the ice it''s a little dark which makes the background distracting (hope that makes sense).  Not a very good crop.</td>', 'What''s outrageous about it?  I''m also not sure where you want my focus to be.  Your eyes sort of take you to the background in which the ice is distracating...but if you want us to the look at the ice it''s a little dark which makes the background distracting (hope that makes sense).  Not a very good crop.', '2010-01-05 10:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796765, 843647, 56828, '<td valign="top">I like how the lighting is backlight giving it a nice light on the edges.  Not really sure how this fits thet sound of silence, but giving you the benefit of the doubt. Still a little drak in front and your eyes drift to the lights in the background.</td>', 'I like how the lighting is backlight giving it a nice light on the edges.  Not really sure how this fits thet sound of silence, but giving you the benefit of the doubt. Still a little drak in front and your eyes drift to the lights in the background.', '2010-01-05 10:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796766, 843876, 56828, '<td valign="top">The photo seems out of focus.</td>', 'The photo seems out of focus.', '2010-01-05 10:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796767, 844312, 56828, '<td valign="top">The color scheme doens''t really work well here.  At least not on this subject.</td>', 'The color scheme doens''t really work well here.  At least not on this subject.', '2010-01-05 10:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796770, 844268, 56828, '<td valign="top">Your depth of field could have been better.  Using a lower Aperture (high number) it would have been bette to see photo in focus.  Looking horizon I know the photo is level...but looking at your bench makes me think it is on a slant.  If you were directly behind it rather than at an angle you could have fixed that effect.</td>', 'Your depth of field could have been better.  Using a lower Aperture (high number) it would have been bette to see photo in focus.  Looking horizon I know the photo is level...but looking at your bench makes me think it is on a slant.  If you were directly behind it rather than at an angle you could have fixed that effect.', '2010-01-05 10:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796772, 844326, 56828, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite get how the title fits this photo.  I see the stairs and assuming that''s what you wanted to be associated with leaving a lover, but it doesn''t quite work.   I like the color scheme here.  I like the soft focus effect.  I''m not one to stick people for shadows becuase i think they add character...although I don''t really like the two shadows coming from the hand rail on the wall...one would be enough.</td>', 'I don''t quite get how the title fits this photo.  I see the stairs and assuming that''s what you wanted to be associated with leaving a lover, but it doesn''t quite work.   I like the color scheme here.  I like the soft focus effect.  I''m not one to stick people for shadows becuase i think they add character...although I don''t really like the two shadows coming from the hand rail on the wall...one would be enough.', '2010-01-05 10:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796773, 843741, 56828, '<td valign="top">Great focus, but there are just too many branches in the way.  Makes the photo look incredibly busy.</td>', 'Great focus, but there are just too many branches in the way.  Makes the photo look incredibly busy.', '2010-01-05 10:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796775, 844608, 56828, '<td valign="top">The sun provides great lighting on the rocks.  I think this is a great landscape photo.  I don''t think the title works here.  I''m assuming you are referring to the sun, but the sun is the last thing I look at.  It''s not really a focus point on the photo.  Even when I do look at it, I''m stil pulled away from it.</td>', 'The sun provides great lighting on the rocks.  I think this is a great landscape photo.  I don''t think the title works here.  I''m assuming you are referring to the sun, but the sun is the last thing I look at.  It''s not really a focus point on the photo.  Even when I do look at it, I''m stil pulled away from it.', '2010-01-05 10:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796778, 844388, 30049, '<td valign="top">I love your Free Study entry, although this one''s nice too.  :-)</td>', 'I love your Free Study entry, although this one''s nice too.  :-)', '2010-01-05 10:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796781, 843720, 56828, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice photo of a rock, but it''s kind of plain.  I like the color scheme.  The composition is okay also.</td>', 'It''s a nice photo of a rock, but it''s kind of plain.  I like the color scheme.  The composition is okay also.', '2010-01-05 10:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796785, 844353, 56828, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of trying to get the couple together under the snow, but the snow here is pretty dirstracting.  It''s too much and almost like dust.</td>', 'I like the idea of trying to get the couple together under the snow, but the snow here is pretty dirstracting.  It''s too much and almost like dust.', '2010-01-05 10:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796788, 842977, 56828, '<td valign="top">I like the portrait.  The lighting is great.  I think you could have done a little more to make him stand out as a boxer or fighter.  Taped hands, a fist, bruises or something would give off more of a fighters touch.</td>', 'I like the portrait.  The lighting is great.  I think you could have done a little more to make him stand out as a boxer or fighter.  Taped hands, a fist, bruises or something would give off more of a fighters touch.', '2010-01-05 10:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796789, 843639, 56828, '<td valign="top">I like the hazy shade of winter aspect.  I think one of few who actually had the hazy part in the photo.  I''m not a big fan of the composition.  I think the tree and the dead foliage below it is distracting from the photo rather than helping it.</td>', 'I like the hazy shade of winter aspect.  I think one of few who actually had the hazy part in the photo.  I''m not a big fan of the composition.  I think the tree and the dead foliage below it is distracting from the photo rather than helping it.', '2010-01-05 10:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796790, 844341, 56828, '<td valign="top">I think the macro shot could have had better focus.  And maybe even a tigheter crop.  not sure why all the additional space on the left.</td>', 'I think the macro shot could have had better focus.  And maybe even a tigheter crop.  not sure why all the additional space on the left.', '2010-01-05 10:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796791, 844379, 56828, '<td valign="top">All the blurred lines and hte red are very distracting from the photo.  Also if you are going to use center composition like this, I think your subject should have been much bigger.</td>', 'All the blurred lines and hte red are very distracting from the photo.  Also if you are going to use center composition like this, I think your subject should have been much bigger.', '2010-01-05 10:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796797, 844079, 56828, '<td valign="top">A portrait of a gorilla doesn''t really tell me African skies.  I like the photo itself.  the black and white conversion works well here.  I like the tight crop.  Some people may give you crap about too much negative space on the right, but I like it there.</td>', 'A portrait of a gorilla doesn''t really tell me African skies.  I like the photo itself.  the black and white conversion works well here.  I like the tight crop.  Some people may give you crap about too much negative space on the right, but I like it there.', '2010-01-05 10:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
