(5803573, 844559, 93756, '<td valign="top">I love topaz but this is a little over the top. Nice composition and meets the challenge well.</td>', 'I love topaz but this is a little over the top. Nice composition and meets the challenge well.', '2010-01-09 08:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
