(5805112, 844259, 83313, '<td valign="top">Coming back to this one. Does not look photographic in nature dur to the heavy PP, and I can''t really tell what the figures are. (Cutouts, perhaps?) However, I can easily see something like this being used on an album cover, so I feel it suits the topic more than a lot of other entries. Bumping it up a couple of notches.</td>', 'Coming back to this one. Does not look photographic in nature dur to the heavy PP, and I can''t really tell what the figures are. (Cutouts, perhaps?) However, I can easily see something like this being used on an album cover, so I feel it suits the topic more than a lot of other entries. Bumping it up a couple of notches.', '2010-01-10 19:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
