(5805830, 844244, 24454, '<td valign="top">Chris, CONGRATULATIONS!  You are fast becoming my new FAVORITE portrait photographer!  Wow!  As far as color vs. black &amp; white /sepia, I think you have a case where you couldn''t go wrong.  Either one would have won top honors.  I tend to be like you tho and for some reason generally prefer color photography, but I don''t know in this case -- I think you did pick the right one.  It is strong and AMAZING!<br/></td>', 'Chris, CONGRATULATIONS!  You are fast becoming my new FAVORITE portrait photographer!  Wow!  As far as color vs. black & white /sepia, I think you have a case where you couldn''t go wrong.  Either one would have won top honors.  I tend to be like you tho and for some reason generally prefer color photography, but I don''t know in this case -- I think you did pick the right one.  It is strong and AMAZING!', '2010-01-11 08:37:12.000000', NULL, 0),
