(5805851, 844407, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ahhhhh. . . one of my favorite memories ever was being right at that very spot a few weeks ago with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=12809" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ButterflySis</a> at 1:00am for pictures.  One of the most breathtaking places to be on the planet!  I love your version.  It brings back happy memories.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ahhhhh. . . one of my favorite memories ever was being right at that very spot a few weeks ago with  ButterflySis at 1:00am for pictures.  One of the most breathtaking places to be on the planet!  I love your version.  It brings back happy memories. ', '2010-01-11 08:46:44.000000', NULL, 0),
