(5806123, 844613, 90098, '<td valign="top">Actually this does have an association with the civil war.  The first shot fired, starting the civil war, was fired less than a mile away from this very spot.  This tree is standing in the cradle of the civil war.  There was no way for me to get that across however.</td>', 'Actually this does have an association with the civil war.  The first shot fired, starting the civil war, was fired less than a mile away from this very spot.  This tree is standing in the cradle of the civil war.  There was no way for me to get that across however.', '2010-01-11 12:44:26.000000', NULL, 0),
