(5806331, 844620, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nicely shot "product" type shot, with good even light, simple background, very good detail.  HOWEVER - negative five points for not listening to a Paul Simon song, you young whippersnapper!  Listen to one or two.  OK, so maybe not your cup of tea, but oh my does that ever make me feel old....  :-)  Score probably has more to do with not meeting the challenge per se than the photograph itself.</td>', 'Very nicely shot "product" type shot, with good even light, simple background, very good detail.  HOWEVER - negative five points for not listening to a Paul Simon song, you young whippersnapper!  Listen to one or two.  OK, so maybe not your cup of tea, but oh my does that ever make me feel old....  :-)  Score probably has more to do with not meeting the challenge per se than the photograph itself.', '2010-01-11 15:21:09.000000', NULL, 0),
