(5806342, 843639, 30982, '<td valign="top">Underscored in my book - not exactly sure why other than one commenter mentioned it isn''t so much about the sky.  Had you just gone with "Hazy Shade of Winter" as many did, you might have fared better with those who don''t know the lyrics.  I like the wide view, the composition to include the foreground, and the distant mist.  Works for me just fine.</td>', 'Underscored in my book - not exactly sure why other than one commenter mentioned it isn''t so much about the sky.  Had you just gone with "Hazy Shade of Winter" as many did, you might have fared better with those who don''t know the lyrics.  I like the wide view, the composition to include the foreground, and the distant mist.  Works for me just fine.', '2010-01-11 15:24:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5806347, 844109, 51538, '<td valign="top">I think you did a great job on this one and it was well worth the organization to make it happen...</td>', 'I think you did a great job on this one and it was well worth the organization to make it happen...', '2010-01-11 15:25:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5806364, 844382, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love Raish''s comment on this is the TS thread.  This really is a wonderful portrait and it''s just right on my laptop.  I suspect my home monitor might have been a touch darker.  The thing with "dark" is you have to do it so it suits you.  The differences in monitors means you''ll never have it look the same to everyone.  He is such a beautiful child.</td>', 'I love Raish''s comment on this is the TS thread.  This really is a wonderful portrait and it''s just right on my laptop.  I suspect my home monitor might have been a touch darker.  The thing with "dark" is you have to do it so it suits you.  The differences in monitors means you''ll never have it look the same to everyone.  He is such a beautiful child.', '2010-01-11 15:30:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5806367, 844379, 30982, '<td valign="top">And like it you should!  Lovely, floating on a sea of dyed silk.  Not many get to see the moon that way.</td>', 'And like it you should!  Lovely, floating on a sea of dyed silk.  Not many get to see the moon that way.', '2010-01-11 15:33:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5806368, 844467, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh, and PS - I don''t care much for guns - in person, in pictures, whatever.  But this is one of the rare exceptions in that it truly does convey the lyrics very well.</td>', 'Oh, and PS - I don''t care much for guns - in person, in pictures, whatever.  But this is one of the rare exceptions in that it truly does convey the lyrics very well.', '2010-01-11 15:35:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5806369, 844610, 86447, '<td valign="top">LOL!</td>', 'LOL!', '2010-01-11 15:36:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5806375, 844386, 30982, '<td valign="top">Clever use of the star filter, and a really good job with the crafty bit to get the "diamonds" on the shoes.  I''ll agree that maybe a closer crop might have more impact, but leaving in the upper legs gives the context that a close crop might not (ie the feet just sorta hanging there).  A good literal interpretation which was rewarded with a very good score!  (By the way, I saw him perform this song live - you really ought to listen to it!)</td>', 'Clever use of the star filter, and a really good job with the crafty bit to get the "diamonds" on the shoes.  I''ll agree that maybe a closer crop might have more impact, but leaving in the upper legs gives the context that a close crop might not (ie the feet just sorta hanging there).  A good literal interpretation which was rewarded with a very good score!  (By the way, I saw him perform this song live - you really ought to listen to it!)', '2010-01-11 15:39:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5806383, 844555, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m on a slow connection, so this came in from the top down.  As it appeared, it made me smile and kept smiling.  Sometimes I think all of our photographs should be presented that way - slowly "drawn" for us as we watch.  I''m not concerned with the hows on this one.  The end effect is EXACTLY what it needs to be.  You done good.</td>', 'I''m on a slow connection, so this came in from the top down.  As it appeared, it made me smile and kept smiling.  Sometimes I think all of our photographs should be presented that way - slowly "drawn" for us as we watch.  I''m not concerned with the hows on this one.  The end effect is EXACTLY what it needs to be.  You done good.', '2010-01-11 15:44:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5806388, 844585, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very "Jeb" photograph and very apt for the lyrics!  Can''t see anything that should be done any differently.  Nice work!  (And you pleased both halves of the Postie/Skewsme team, as well as Jan and Mary.  Pretty fine crowd there!)</td>', 'A very "Jeb" photograph and very apt for the lyrics!  Can''t see anything that should be done any differently.  Nice work!  (And you pleased both halves of the Postie/Skewsme team, as well as Jan and Mary.  Pretty fine crowd there!)', '2010-01-11 15:50:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5806393, 842310, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very much my kind of picture!  I''m always interested to see which lenses you use.  This isn''t something I''d associate with the 100mm - I really need to take that beastie out more often.</td>', 'Very much my kind of picture!  I''m always interested to see which lenses you use.  This isn''t something I''d associate with the 100mm - I really need to take that beastie out more often.', '2010-01-11 15:52:51.000000', NULL, 0),
