(5806504, 844211, 61084, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by IreneM:</b></div><hr/><i> Oliver? You''ve changed your name? H2? I thought your "old" name was one of the best user names I''d ever heard.... oh well...   Ooops, nearly forgot. Congratulations on ribboning. Super shot. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I realized he changed it right after he did it. I had to look around and said to myself who is this H2 person with all these ribbons and I never heard of him. LOL.<br/> <br/>For the record. I preferred Eyewave as well, but we all have our reasons.</td>', 'Originally posted by IreneM: Oliver? You''ve changed your name? H2? I thought your "old" name was one of the best user names I''d ever heard.... oh well...   Ooops, nearly forgot. Congratulations on ribboning. Super shot.   I realized he changed it right after he did it. I had to look around and said to myself who is this H2 person with all these ribbons and I never heard of him. LOL. For the record. I preferred Eyewave as well, but we all have our reasons.', '2010-01-11 17:34:40.000000', NULL, 0),
