(5807719, 844247, 30982, '<td valign="top">Clever that the linoleum seems to be in period with the Polaroids.  Excellent interpretation of the song and very good job with the falling photos.</td>', 'Clever that the linoleum seems to be in period with the Polaroids.  Excellent interpretation of the song and very good job with the falling photos.', '2010-01-12 15:52:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5807721, 844276, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  This is delightful!  And hilarious!  I like how her bow and dress indicate a fancy occasion (as does the shoe of course) yet he''s dressed quite casually.  Somehow that adds another element.  Nicely done!</td>', 'LOL!  This is delightful!  And hilarious!  I like how her bow and dress indicate a fancy occasion (as does the shoe of course) yet he''s dressed quite casually.  Somehow that adds another element.  Nicely done!', '2010-01-12 15:54:07.000000', NULL, 0),
