(5807723, 843741, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and you managed to catch a bird with an almost sad look to match the lyric of the song.  And I think the too many branches is what makes this work.  I like it.</td>', 'Excellent composition and you managed to catch a bird with an almost sad look to match the lyric of the song.  And I think the too many branches is what makes this work.  I like it.', '2010-01-12 15:55:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5807724, 843846, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a lovely congregation!  Looks like it was a reasonably nice day for a stroll, and for a bit of a fly in for the local flocks.</td>', 'What a lovely congregation!  Looks like it was a reasonably nice day for a stroll, and for a bit of a fly in for the local flocks.', '2010-01-12 15:57:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5807725, 844152, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  I agree - I like the way this makes it seem as though you''re looking through one side of a set of binoculars.  In which case (and as is true with this lens) that bird is awfully darn close!  Amazing clouds.</td>', 'Excellent!  I agree - I like the way this makes it seem as though you''re looking through one side of a set of binoculars.  In which case (and as is true with this lens) that bird is awfully darn close!  Amazing clouds.', '2010-01-12 15:59:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5807726, 844274, 12253, '<td valign="top">Wonderful Deb!  Should have finished much higher...it was one of my 10''s.</td>', 'Wonderful Deb!  Should have finished much higher...it was one of my 10''s.', '2010-01-12 16:01:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5807730, 844467, 90495, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MilaMiles:</b></div><hr/><i> This is a bit disturbing. Some of the hardcore violence should not be allowed, in my opinion. This goes overboard. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>ROFL. The things people say sometimes...<br/> <br/>I hate guns but love to use them in my images. I love the negative comments I get.<br/> <br/>See that 9 vote, that was me. :) <br/> <br/>The only negative aspect I find in this shot is the use of a child but that''s just me.</td>', 'Originally posted by MilaMiles: This is a bit disturbing. Some of the hardcore violence should not be allowed, in my opinion. This goes overboard.   ROFL. The things people say sometimes... I hate guns but love to use them in my images. I love the negative comments I get. See that 9 vote, that was me. :)  The only negative aspect I find in this shot is the use of a child but that''s just me.', '2010-01-12 16:06:17.000000', NULL, 0),
