(5809228, 844556, 24454, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe it only scored 5.5!  It is an extremely undeserved 5.5.   Its a beautiful scene, photographer exquisitely with the light and the contrast of the white tide coming in.   I really love this photo.  I think its getting even harder and harder to get a feel for what will work with the current crop of voters and what won''t.  A little unsettling actually.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I can''t believe it only scored 5.5!  It is an extremely undeserved 5.5.   Its a beautiful scene, photographer exquisitely with the light and the contrast of the white tide coming in.   I really love this photo.  I think its getting even harder and harder to get a feel for what will work with the current crop of voters and what won''t.  A little unsettling actually. ', '2010-01-13 08:57:47.000000', NULL, 0),
