(6171846, 844300, 96751, '<td valign="top">So, what?  Did you schlep this reclining chair to this abandoned room?  That''s something <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=114969" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">gyaban</a> would have done.  No, I take that back, he''d have built the chair, THEN schlepped it to this room. Regardless, this is an exquisite image.  Incredible light.  I''m guessing it was rather humid, which made the rays visible?</td>', 'So, what?  Did you schlep this reclining chair to this abandoned room?  That''s something  gyaban would have done.  No, I take that back, he''d have built the chair, THEN schlepped it to this room. Regardless, this is an exquisite image.  Incredible light.  I''m guessing it was rather humid, which made the rays visible?', '2010-09-26 03:17:38.000000', NULL, 0),
